{
  "dom_id": "step-2263",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Determining Convergence Behavior of Geometric Sequences Written Recursively",
  "problem": "Consider the following sequence: \n\n$$\na_{n+1} = -2a_n, \\qquad a_1 = -4, \\qquad n\\geq 1.\n$$\n\nDetermine whether the sequence is convergent or divergent. If it converges, find the limit.",
  "worked_solution": "Suppose we have a geometric sequence with the first term $a_1$ and common ratio $r.$ Then, we have the following convergence properties:\n\n- if $|r| <      1,$ the sequence is convergent and converges to $0$\n\n- if $|r| > 1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nMoreover, we have the following edge cases:\n\n- if $r=1,$ the sequence is convergent and converges to $a_1$\n\n- if $r= -1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nThe given sequence is a geometric sequence with the common ratio \n\n$$\nr=\\dfrac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}= -2.\n$$\n\nSince $|r| >1$, the sequence diverges.",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-2263\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"2263\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"646\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-2263\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-11\">Determining Convergence Behavior of Geometric Sequences Written Recursively</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"2263\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: